#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/language/gemm_op/index.rst:45
msgid ""
"For manual asynchronous scheduling, use ``T.wgmma_gemm(...)`` with ``T."
"wait_wgmma(...)`` on Hopper, or ``T.tcgen05_gemm(...)`` with ``T."
"mbarrier_wait_parity(...)`` on Blackwell."
msgstr ""

